        "original_id": "4d8c7094-1b22-5116-b3dd-2a919cd79265",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Lianzhou, Yancheng, Guangdong Province, Jiangsu Province, China, Qingyuan, Yangshan, Yingde, Xingzi Town, Momianshi\n- Systems: Lianjiang River\n\nFacts:\n- Lianzhou, formerly called Lian County or Lianxian and postalized as Linhsien, is a county-level city in northern Guangdong Province, China.\n- Lianzhou is administered by the prefecture-level city of Qingyuan.\n- Yancheng is a prefecture-level city in northeastern Jiangsu Province, People's Republic of China.\n- The Lianjiang River rises at Momianshi in Xingzi Town in Lianzhou county.\n- The Lianjiang River runs generally northwest to southeast through Lianzhou, Yangshan, and Yingde counties.",
